{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Return to the genesis of 16-bit gaming with Ancient's brand new shoot 'em up, Earthion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Earth's resources depleted and its environment in ruin, most of humanity has fled to Mars. But when hostile invaders launch an attack on Earth, mankind has no choice but to fight back. As environmental researcher Azusa Takanashi, you'll pilot the state-of-the-art space fighter YK-IIA and mount the most important counterattack in human history. Losing is not an option!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbA brand new, completely authentic retro 2D shooter experience designed on actual 16-bit hardware</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDestroy enemy craft and nab their resources to enhance your ship's capabilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbUtilize various subweapons to deploy a multitude of different strategies and tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPlay through the main story or try Challenge Mode to put your combat abilities to the test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbJam out to Yuzo Koshiro's infectious tunes with the in-game Music Player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDeveloped by Ancient, known for working on beloved 16-bit franchises such as <i>Streets of Rage, Beyond Oasis, </i>and <i>Actraiser</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597580?t=1746542704","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597580/b3211498e52ae916a0b8b5d9c920270cc8b6d9f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746542704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597580/7ae48d2d4e48e22cc828baaeae8bbd351ccbf005/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746542704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597580/7ae48d2d4e48e22cc828baaeae8bbd351ccbf005/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746542704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"de